Pasal 6
Kekerasan seksual sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 3 huruf c disebabkan karena:
a. perbuatan yang berupa pelecehan seksual;
b. pemaksaan hubungan seksual;
c. pemaksaan hubungan seksual dengan tidak wajar atau tidak disukai;
dan/atau
d. pemaksaan hubungan seksual dengan orang lain untuk tujuan komersial dan atau tujuan tertentu.

translated_text:
Article 6
Sexual violence as referred to in Article 3 letter c is caused by:
a. acts in the form of sexual harassment;
b. forced sexual intercourse;
c. forced sexual intercourse in an unnatural or unwanted manner;
and/or
d. forced sexual intercourse with another person for commercial purposes and/or specific purposes.

Article 7
Neglect as referred to in Article 3 letter d is caused by:
a. acts that result in the failure to fulfill the needs of children properly, whether physical, mental, spiritual or social, committed by parents, guardians, or other parties responsible for care;
b. acts of deliberately neglecting to maintain, care for, or look after children as appropriate, committed by parents, guardians or any other party responsible for their care;
c. acts of neglecting a person within the scope of their household, whereas according to the law applicable to them or due to an agreement or contract they are obligated to provide livelihood, care, or maintenance to that person; and/or
d. acts that result in economic dependency by means of limiting and/or prohibiting proper work inside or outside the home so that the victim is under the control of that person.

